{"title":"Career Roadmap · Airline Ticketing Executive","role":"Airline Ticketing Executive","summary":"Airline Ticketing Executive is a practical entry-level career for graduates from Tourism & Travel Management, BTTM and hospitality-related programmes. The role focuses on airline reservations, ticket issuance, itinerary management, fare rules, rebooking, cancellations, refunds and passenger assistance.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["The strongest candidates combine airline/ticketing knowledge","GDS technology","customer service","travel documentation","Excel/data skills."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"note","label":"Career positioning","text":"Airline Ticketing Executive is primarily an entry-level operational role. With experience, it can lead to Senior Ticketing Executive, Reservation Supervisor, Ticketing Manager, Travel Operations Manager, Corporate Travel Manager or broader airline/travel-management roles."}]},{"heading":"Career Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Details"],"rows":[[{"text":"Primary function"},{"text":"Airline reservations and ticketing"}],[{"text":"Industry"},{"text":"Airlines, travel agencies, OTAs, corporate travel companies, airport travel services"}],[{"text":"Entry level"},{"text":"Airline Ticketing Executive / Ticketing Executive"}],[{"text":"Related roles"},{"text":"Reservation Executive, Travel Consultant, Reservation Agent, Airline Reservation Executive"}],[{"text":"Core technology"},{"text":"GDS, airline reservation systems, CRM, booking platforms"}],[{"text":"Key knowledge"},{"text":"Fares, schedules, PNRs, ticketing, reissue, cancellation, refund"}],[{"text":"Key strengths"},{"text":"Accuracy, communication, patience, attention to detail"}],[{"text":"Long-term potential"},{"text":"Ticketing Supervisor → Ticketing Manager → Travel Operations Manager"}]]}]},{"heading":"What Does an Airline Ticketing Executive Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Airline Ticketing Executive helps customers and travel businesses search, book, modify and manage air travel."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Searching flight schedules"},{"text":"Checking seat availability"},{"text":"Creating passenger reservations"},{"text":"Creating and managing PNRs"},{"text":"Issuing airline tickets"},{"text":"Explaining fare conditions"},{"text":"Processing cancellations"},{"text":"Processing reissues"},{"text":"Handling itinerary changes"},{"text":"Processing/referring refund requests"},{"text":"Explaining baggage allowances"},{"text":"Assisting with special service requests"},{"text":"Supporting web check-in and passenger queries"},{"text":"Coordinating with airlines"},{"text":"Handling corporate travel bookings"},{"text":"Maintaining booking records"},{"text":"Managing customer documentation"},{"text":"Communicating schedule changes"},{"text":"Supporting travel agents and corporate clients"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Accuracy is extremely important because an incorrect booking, passenger name or fare calculation can create significant operational and financial problems."}]},{"heading":"Important Knowledge Areas","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A student should understand the complete airline-ticketing workflow."},{"type":"h","text":"Passenger journey"},{"type":"h","text":"Search"},{"type":"h","text":"Availability"},{"type":"h","text":"Reservation"},{"type":"h","text":"PNR creation"},{"type":"h","text":"Fare calculation"},{"type":"h","text":"Ticket issuance"},{"type":"h","text":"Itinerary confirmation"},{"type":"h","text":"Pre-travel changes"},{"type":"h","text":"Check-in"},{"type":"h","text":"Travel"},{"type":"h","text":"Reissue / cancellation / refund if required"}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During Your Degree","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Travel & Aviation Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a strong foundation."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tourism fundamentals"},{"text":"Travel geography"},{"text":"Airline industry structure"},{"text":"Airport operations"},{"text":"Airline terminology"},{"text":"International time zones"},{"text":"Major airports"},{"text":"IATA airport codes"},{"text":"Aircraft basics"},{"text":"Domestic vs international travel"},{"text":"Passenger journey"},{"text":"Travel documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Essential knowledge"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn airport codes such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DEL — Delhi"},{"text":"BOM — Mumbai"},{"text":"HYD — Hyderabad"},{"text":"BLR — Bengaluru"},{"text":"MAA — Chennai"},{"text":"DXB — Dubai"},{"text":"SIN — Singapore"},{"text":"LHR — London"},{"text":"JFK — New York"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not simply memorise codes. Learn how city, airport and airline codes are used in reservation systems."}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Reservation & Ticketing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This should become the student's core technical area."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airline reservation systems"},{"text":"PNR creation"},{"text":"Passenger details"},{"text":"Flight availability"},{"text":"Fare basis"},{"text":"Fare rules"},{"text":"Ticketing time limits"},{"text":"Baggage rules"},{"text":"Seat selection"},{"text":"Special service requests"},{"text":"Ancillary services"},{"text":"Cancellation"},{"text":"Rebooking"},{"text":"Reissue"},{"text":"Refund processes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"GDS"},{"type":"p","text":"Gain practical exposure to major Global Distribution System environments such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Amadeus"},{"text":"Sabre"},{"text":"Travelport"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact system used by an employer varies."},{"type":"p","text":"A student should understand that GDS proficiency can materially improve employability for ticketing and travel-operations jobs."}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Advanced Ticketing & Travel Operations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Move beyond basic booking."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"h","text":"Fares"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Published fares"},{"text":"Fare rules"},{"text":"Fare basis"},{"text":"Taxes"},{"text":"Fees"},{"text":"Change penalties"},{"text":"Cancellation penalties"},{"text":"Refund calculations"},{"text":"Fare differences"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ticket changes"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reissue"},{"text":"Revalidation"},{"text":"Date change"},{"text":"Route change"},{"text":"Name correction policies"},{"text":"Schedule-change handling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Passenger services"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wheelchair requests"},{"text":"Unaccompanied minor procedures"},{"text":"Special meals"},{"text":"Medical assistance coordination"},{"text":"Infant/child travel requirements"},{"text":"Special baggage"}]},{"type":"h","text":"International travel"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the basics of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passport requirements"},{"text":"Visa requirements"},{"text":"Transit requirements"},{"text":"Immigration"},{"text":"Travel insurance"},{"text":"Country-specific entry rules"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Visa and entry requirements change frequently, so professional travel staff must verify current official requirements rather than relying on memorised information."}]},{"heading":"Year 4 — Professional Ticketing & Business Travel","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"If the programme is four years, develop higher-level commercial skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corporate travel management"},{"text":"Group bookings"},{"text":"Travel policy"},{"text":"Business travel"},{"text":"Travel expense concepts"},{"text":"Airline contracts"},{"text":"Travel agency operations"},{"text":"Customer relationship management"},{"text":"Travel technology"},{"text":"Revenue fundamentals"},{"text":"Travel analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic SQL"},{"text":"Basic Python"}]},{"type":"p","text":"These are not mandatory for traditional ticketing roles but can help you transition into travel operations, business travel, revenue, MIS or travel-tech analytics."}]},{"heading":"Four-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Focus","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Travel fundamentals"},{"text":"Geography, aviation, airport & airline basics"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Ticketing"},{"text":"GDS, PNR, fares, reservations"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Advanced ticketing"},{"text":"Reissue, refunds, international travel, SSR"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Travel business"},{"text":"Corporate travel, analytics, CRM, operations"}]]}]},{"heading":"Practical Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A student should create practical evidence of ticketing knowledge."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Flight Booking Simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a simulated booking workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Customer requirement","Flight search","Availability","Fare selection","PNR","Ticket","Itinerary"]},{"type":"p","text":"Document every step."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Fare Comparison Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airline"},{"text":"Route"},{"text":"Departure time"},{"text":"Arrival time"},{"text":"Base fare"},{"text":"Taxes"},{"text":"Baggage"},{"text":"Change fee"},{"text":"Cancellation fee"},{"text":"Total price"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel / Power BI"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Travel Itinerary Builder"},{"type":"p","text":"Create sample itineraries for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business traveller"},{"text":"Family vacation"},{"text":"Student traveller"},{"text":"International tourist"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Flights"},{"text":"Connection time"},{"text":"Airport"},{"text":"Baggage"},{"text":"Hotel"},{"text":"Transfers"},{"text":"Travel requirements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Ticket Change Case Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Create scenarios involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Date change"},{"text":"Flight cancellation"},{"text":"Airline schedule change"},{"text":"Missed connection"},{"text":"Refund request"},{"text":"Fare difference"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Explain the appropriate operational response."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Travel Operations Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a dashboard showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bookings"},{"text":"Routes"},{"text":"Airline"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Cancellation rate"},{"text":"Rebooking rate"},{"text":"Average ticket value"},{"text":"Domestic vs international bookings"},{"text":"Customer segment"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Tools","text":"Excel / Power BI"}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Internship experience is highly valuable."},{"type":"h","text":"Target employers"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airlines"},{"text":"Travel agencies"},{"text":"Online travel companies"},{"text":"Corporate travel companies"},{"text":"Airport service companies"},{"text":"Destination management companies"},{"text":"Tour operators"},{"text":"Business travel agencies"},{"text":"Travel-tech companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Departments"},{"type":"p","text":"Prioritise:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airline reservations"},{"text":"Ticketing"},{"text":"Travel operations"},{"text":"Corporate travel"},{"text":"Customer service"},{"text":"Airport/airline operations"}]}]},{"heading":"What to Learn During Internship","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Do not focus only on obtaining the internship certificate."},{"type":"p","text":"Try to gain experience in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GDS"},{"text":"PNR handling"},{"text":"Fare display"},{"text":"Ticket issuance"},{"text":"Reissue"},{"text":"Cancellation"},{"text":"Refund"},{"text":"Customer communication"},{"text":"Airline schedule changes"},{"text":"Travel documentation"},{"text":"Corporate booking"},{"text":"CRM"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The most valuable outcome is:"},{"type":"p","text":"“I can independently handle a standard reservation and understand the operational process behind it.”"}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"GDS Training"},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most useful areas for the career."},{"type":"p","text":"Consider structured training in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Amadeus"},{"text":"Sabre"},{"text":"Travelport"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Choose based on the systems commonly used by employers you are targeting."},{"type":"h","text":"IATA / Travel Training"},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant areas can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airfares and ticketing"},{"text":"Travel and tourism"},{"text":"Airline reservations"},{"text":"Travel operations"},{"text":"Customer service"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Verify the current course structure, recognition and fees before enrolling."},{"type":"h","text":"Other Useful Skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Data validation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"DAX basics"},{"text":"Dashboard design"},{"text":"KPI reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Professional email"},{"text":"Telephone etiquette"},{"text":"Customer complaint handling"},{"text":"Cross-cultural communication"}]}]},{"heading":"Foreign Language Advantage","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Foreign-language capability can be valuable in international travel."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential choices:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"French"},{"text":"German"},{"text":"Spanish"},{"text":"Arabic"},{"text":"Japanese"},{"text":"Mandarin"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["English","Hindi/regional language","Arabic/French/German"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"can improve suitability for certain international travel and hospitality environments."}]},{"heading":"Jobs You Can Be Hired For","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct-entry roles"},{"type":"p","text":"After graduation, realistic titles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airline Ticketing Executive"},{"text":"Ticketing Executive"},{"text":"Airline Reservation Executive"},{"text":"Reservation Executive"},{"text":"Reservation Agent"},{"text":"Travel Consultant"},{"text":"Travel Operations Executive"},{"text":"Air Ticketing Executive"},{"text":"Travel Desk Executive"},{"text":"Corporate Travel Executive"},{"text":"Flight Reservation Executive"},{"text":"Customer Service Executive – Travel"},{"text":"Travel Coordinator"},{"text":"GDS Executive"},{"text":"Ticketing Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Travel-tech roles"},{"type":"p","text":"With additional technology skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Travel Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Travel Data Analyst"},{"text":"Travel MIS Executive"},{"text":"Travel Business Analyst"},{"text":"OTA Operations Executive"},{"text":"Revenue Operations Associate"}]}]},{"heading":"Employer-Ready Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Airline fundamentals"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Travel geography"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"IATA airport codes"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Reservation process"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"PNR"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Fare rules"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Ticket issuance"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Reissue"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Cancellation/refund"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"GDS"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Customer service"},{"text":"Excellent"}],[{"text":"English communication"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Intermediate/Advanced"}],[{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Working knowledge"}],[{"text":"International travel"},{"text":"Working knowledge"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic/Intermediate"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Basic"}],[{"text":"Foreign language"},{"text":"Advantage"}]]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A postgraduate degree is not required to become an Airline Ticketing Executive."},{"type":"p","text":"Professional experience and GDS capability are often more immediately relevant."},{"type":"p","text":"However, PG education can help with progression."},{"type":"h","text":"MBA Travel & Tourism Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Travel operations"},{"text":"Tourism management"},{"text":"Destination management"},{"text":"Travel business"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA Aviation Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airline operations"},{"text":"Airport management"},{"text":"Aviation business"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA Hospitality Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hospitality operations"},{"text":"Hotel/travel management"},{"text":"Customer experience"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA International Business"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"International travel"},{"text":"Corporate travel"},{"text":"Global business"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Travel analytics"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Customer analytics"},{"text":"Travel-tech"}]}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Travel and aviation are global industries, so international exposure can be useful."},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant postgraduate areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"International Tourism Management"},{"text":"Aviation Management"},{"text":"Airline Management"},{"text":"Travel Management"},{"text":"Hospitality Management"},{"text":"Tourism Business"},{"text":"Destination Management"},{"text":"Aviation Business"},{"text":"Travel Technology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential markets include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UAE"},{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Europe"},{"text":"Middle East"},{"text":"Southeast Asia"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Actual work eligibility depends on the destination's immigration and employment rules."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A realistic progression can look like:"},{"type":"h","text":"BTTM / BHM / Hospitality Graduate"},{"type":"h","text":"Airline Ticketing Executive"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Ticketing Executive"},{"type":"h","text":"Ticketing Supervisor"},{"type":"h","text":"Ticketing Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Travel Operations Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Travel Operations Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Travel Business / Operations Head"},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative progression 1 — Corporate Travel"},{"type":"h","text":"Ticketing Executive"},{"type":"flow","items":["Corporate Travel Executive","Corporate Travel Consultant","Senior Corporate Travel Consultant","Corporate Travel Manager","Travel Programme Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative progression 2 — Travel Technology"},{"type":"h","text":"Ticketing Executive"},{"type":"flow","items":["Travel Operations Analyst","Travel Business Analyst","Senior Travel Analyst","Travel Product/Operations Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative progression 3 — Airline Operations"},{"type":"h","text":"Ticketing/Reservations"},{"type":"flow","items":["Passenger Service","Airport Operations","Duty Manager","Airport Operations Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative progression 4 — Revenue Management"},{"type":"p","text":"With strong analytical skills:"},{"type":"h","text":"Ticketing"},{"type":"flow","items":["Revenue Operations Analyst","Revenue Analyst","Revenue Management Specialist","Revenue Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"This route requires stronger knowledge of pricing, demand, forecasting and analytics."}]},{"heading":"Specialisation Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. International Ticketing"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"International fares"},{"text":"Complex itineraries"},{"text":"Transit"},{"text":"Visa/documentation awareness"},{"text":"Reissue/refund"},{"text":"Multi-sector travel"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Corporate Travel"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business travellers"},{"text":"Corporate travel policies"},{"text":"Negotiated fares"},{"text":"Travel management"},{"text":"Expense coordination"},{"text":"Traveller profiles"},{"text":"Duty of care"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Airline Reservations"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PNR management"},{"text":"Availability"},{"text":"Schedule changes"},{"text":"Passenger service"},{"text":"Reservation operations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. GDS Specialist"},{"type":"p","text":"Become highly proficient in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Amadeus"},{"text":"Sabre"},{"text":"Travelport"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This can be particularly valuable for travel agencies and corporate travel environments."},{"type":"h","text":"5. Revenue & Pricing"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Demand forecasting"},{"text":"Fare analysis"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Occupancy/load factor concepts"},{"text":"Revenue optimisation"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Python"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This provides a stronger analytical career path."}]},{"heading":"AI & Technology Impact","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Airline ticketing is increasingly becoming technology-driven."},{"type":"p","text":"AI and automation can assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Flight search"},{"text":"Fare comparison"},{"text":"Customer FAQs"},{"text":"Booking recommendations"},{"text":"Itinerary generation"},{"text":"Rebooking"},{"text":"Schedule-change notifications"},{"text":"Travel documentation checks"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Fraud detection"},{"text":"Personalised travel recommendations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Digital travel platforms are also reducing the amount of routine manual booking work."},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore, a ticketing professional should not remain limited to manual ticket issuance."},{"type":"p","text":"The career becomes stronger when the employee understands:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Travel operations","GDS","customer experience","data","automation"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"AI-Era Career Evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Traditional profile"},{"type":"h","text":"Ticketing Executive"},{"type":"flow","items":["Booking","Ticketing","Cancellation","Customer service"]},{"type":"h","text":"Future profile"},{"type":"h","text":"Travel Operations Specialist"},{"type":"flow","items":["GDS","Travel technology","Customer analytics","Automation","Revenue optimisation","AI-assisted travel servicing"]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful AI-era skills include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"Prompting for travel workflows"},{"text":"Customer sentiment analysis"},{"text":"Automated itinerary generation"},{"text":"Data analytics"},{"text":"Travel recommendation systems"},{"text":"AI-assisted customer support"},{"text":"Fraud/risk awareness"}]}]},{"heading":"What AI Will Not Easily Replace","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Human professionals will remain valuable for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Complex itineraries"},{"text":"High-value corporate clients"},{"text":"Difficult rebooking situations"},{"text":"Disruptions and cancellations"},{"text":"Complex international travel"},{"text":"Customer complaints"},{"text":"Special travel requirements"},{"text":"Emergency travel situations"},{"text":"Relationship management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore, problem-solving and customer communication remain important even as routine ticketing becomes increasingly automated."}]},{"heading":"Ideal Graduate Profile","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should be able to demonstrate:"},{"type":"p","text":"“I understand airline and travel operations, can use a GDS for reservations and ticketing, understand PNRs and fare rules, can handle reissue/cancellation workflows, communicate professionally with customers, understand international travel requirements, and can analyse travel operations using Excel and Power BI.”"},{"type":"p","text":"That is much stronger than simply having:"},{"type":"p","text":"“BTTM + ticketing certificate.”"}]},{"heading":"Best Practical Path","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BTTM / BHM / B.Sc Hospitality"},{"type":"flow","items":["Learn aviation and travel fundamentals","Master IATA airport/airline terminology","Learn Amadeus / Sabre / Travelport","Learn PNR creation","Learn fares and ticketing","Learn reissue, cancellation and refund processes","Learn international travel documentation","Complete internship in airline/travel operations","Build Excel skills","Learn Power BI + basic SQL","Build a flight fare comparison project","Build a travel operations dashboard","Apply for:"]},{"type":"h","text":"Airline Ticketing Executive / Reservation Executive / Travel Consultant / GDS Executive"},{"type":"flow","items":["Gain 1–2 years of operational experience","Choose a specialisation:"]},{"type":"p","text":"Corporate Travel / International Ticketing / Airline Reservations / GDS / Revenue Management / Travel Analytics\n→ Progress toward:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Senior Ticketing Executive","Supervisor","Ticketing/Travel Operations Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best AI-era combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["GDS","Airline Ticketing","Travel Operations","Customer Service","Excel/Power BI","AI Literacy","Foreign Language"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This gives the graduate a pathway not only into traditional ticketing, but also into corporate travel, airline operations, travel technology, revenue management and travel analytics."}]}]}